<title>USA: Disney raises qtly payout.</title>
<headline>Disney raises qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co Monday raised its quarterly dividend to $0.1325 a share from $0.11 cents, payable May 16 to shareholders of record on April 11.</p>
</text>
